{"channelId":"UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","row":["The Scottsdale Veterinary Clinic",62,"The Scottsdale Veterinary Clinic was established over 60 years ago as the first Pet Veterinary Center in Scottsdale, Arizona. All of our Doctors and Staff are animal lovers with pets of their own, ranging from dogs and cats to parrots, rabbits, rats, guinea pigs, ferrets, reptiles, and other birds and exotic pets. Our team understands and treasures the bond between you and your pet. We share in the joy and love that animal companionship brings into our lives everyday. We offer a large range of services and therapies that make our hospital unique. We offer emergency medicine, exotic pet and avian services, bone surgery, vaccines and other preventative care, health certificates for travel, neuter, spay, declaw, dental cleaning, in home humane euthanasia, holistic vet services, acupuncture and more!\n\nFollow us:  \nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/scottsdalevet/\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/tsvcpets/\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/tsvc\nGoogle +: https://plus.google.com/+Tsvcpets","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:54.663Z","channelId":"UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e56854ec89acd95c2a94bd9dff7a03d25df02ccf5409d596e85f8e761bf2b2fa","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"84d9c3c9549687512610f32c7426861fe958179778f73d47b8049da7c0ee78b6"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":62,"raw":"62 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQUjdmD0xgCqyb04Lf4IaZQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:54.663Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeyw